sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer as Producer<br/>(External Client)
    participant Redis as Redis / Valkey<br/>6379/TCP
    participant AP as Async Processor
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>9090/TCP HTTP
    participant Router as llm-d-router<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Consumer as Consumer<br/>(External Client)
    participant OTLP as OTLP Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC

    Note over Producer,Consumer: Flow 1: Async Request Processing (Redis Sorted Set)

    Producer->>Redis: ZADD request to sorted-set<br/>6379/TCP, Optional TLS<br/>URL credentials
    AP->>Redis: ZPOPMIN poll for requests<br/>6379/TCP, Optional TLS
    Redis-->>AP: Request message<br/>(W3C trace context propagated)

    AP->>Prom: PromQL capacity query<br/>9090/TCP HTTP, No auth
    Prom-->>AP: Pool saturation metrics

    Note over AP: Gate evaluation:<br/>Queue gate + Pool gate<br/>Budget + Quota + Composite

    alt Gate allows dispatch
        AP->>Router: HTTP POST inference request<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+ / mTLS<br/>x-llm-d-inference-fairness-id header
        Router-->>AP: Inference response
        AP->>Redis: LPUSH result to result list<br/>6379/TCP, Optional TLS
        Consumer->>Redis: BRPOP wait for result<br/>6379/TCP, Optional TLS
        Redis-->>Consumer: Inference result
        AP->>OTLP: Export trace span<br/>4317/TCP gRPC, Optional TLS
    else Gate refuses (capacity exceeded)
        Note over AP: Wait-on-refuse:<br/>jittered backoff,<br/>park up to gate-wait-timeout (5m)
        AP->>AP: Re-evaluate gate after backoff
    end

    Note over Producer,Consumer: Flow 2: Graceful Shutdown and Drain

    Note over AP: Kubernetes sends SIGTERM
    AP->>AP: /readyz returns 503
    AP->>Router: Complete in-flight requests<br/>drain-timeout: 2m
    Router-->>AP: Final responses
    AP->>Redis: ZADD re-enqueue undrained requests<br/>6379/TCP, Optional TLS

    Note over Producer,Consumer: Flow 3: Retry with Exponential Backoff

    Note over AP: Worker receives retryable error
    AP->>AP: Route to retry channel (in-process)
    AP->>Redis: ZADD to retry sorted-set<br/>with backoff score<br/>6379/TCP, Optional TLS
    AP->>Redis: ZPOPMIN retry set when due<br/>6379/TCP, Optional TLS
    Redis-->>AP: Retried request message
